<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Ultrasonic Flaw Detector</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #070d1a;
    --bg-2: #0c1628;
    --panel: rgba(18, 32, 58, 0.72);
    --panel-border: rgba(90, 170, 255, 0.18);
    --text: #e8f0ff;
    --muted: #8fa3c4;
    --accent: #3ea6ff;
    --accent-2: #26e0c4;
    --warn: #ff7a59;
    --good: #4be38a;
    --steel-light: #56698a;
    --font-title: "Space Grotesk", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    --font-body: "Inter", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    --font-mono: "JetBrains Mono", Consolas, monospace;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  html, body {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: #03060d;
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* ---------- Stage (16:9, scaled to screen) ---------- */
  #viewport {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  #stage {
    width: 1280px;
    height: 720px;
    position: relative;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transform-origin: center center;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 10%, rgba(62, 166, 255, 0.16), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 5% 95%, rgba(38, 224, 196, 0.10), transparent 50%),
      linear-gradient(160deg, var(--bg-2), var(--bg));
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
  }

  #stage::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(62, 166, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(62, 166, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 40px 40px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* ---------- Slides ---------- */
  .slide {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    padding: 64px 80px 70px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    transform: translateX(40px);
    transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.5s ease, visibility 0.5s;
  }

  .slide.active {
    opacity: 1;
    visibility: visible;
    transform: translateX(0);
  }

  .slide.prev { transform: translateX(-40px); }

  .reveal {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(18px);
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease;
    transition-delay: calc(var(--i, 0) * 0.12s + 0.15s);
  }

  .slide.active .reveal {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  /* ---------- Typography ---------- */
  .kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .kicker::before {
    content: "";
    width: 28px;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--accent-2);
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-title);
    font-size: 76px;
    line-height: 1.02;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -1.5px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-title);
    font-size: 46px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.8px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-title);
    font-size: 23px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  p, li {
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }

  .grad {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }

  /* ---------- Components ---------- */
  .card {
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 24px 26px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  }

  .icon {
    width: 46px;
    height: 46px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(62, 166, 255, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(62, 166, 255, 0.3);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .icon svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; stroke: var(--accent); fill: none; stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }

  .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 22px; }
  .grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; }

  .big-number {
    font-family: var(--font-title);
    font-size: 58px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .formula {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 26px;
    color: var(--text);
    background: rgba(62, 166, 255, 0.08);
    border: 1px dashed rgba(62, 166, 255, 0.4);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px 22px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  ul.clean { list-style: none; }
  ul.clean li { padding-left: 30px; position: relative; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  ul.clean li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 11px;
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: var(--accent);
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  .pc-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .pc-dot {
    width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .dot-warn { background: rgba(255, 122, 89, 0.15); color: var(--warn); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 122, 89, 0.4); }
  .dot-good { background: rgba(75, 227, 138, 0.15); color: var(--good); border: 1px solid rgba(75, 227, 138, 0.4); }

  /* speaker badge (top right) */
  .speaker {
    position: absolute;
    top: 30px;
    right: 40px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(7, 13, 26, 0.6);
  }
  .speaker b { color: var(--accent-2); font-weight: 500; }

  /* ---------- Animated waves (title slide) ---------- */
  .wave-bg {
    position: absolute;
    right: -120px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: 700px;
    height: 700px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .wave-bg circle {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--accent);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    opacity: 0;
    transform-origin: 350px 350px;
    animation: ripple 4s ease-out infinite;
  }
  .wave-bg circle:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 1s; }
  .wave-bg circle:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 2s; }
  .wave-bg circle:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 3s; }

  @keyframes ripple {
    0%   { transform: scale(0.1); opacity: 0.8; }
    100% { transform: scale(1);   opacity: 0; }
  }

  /* ---------- Pulse-echo diagram animation ---------- */
  .beam-down, .beam-up {
    stroke-dasharray: 8 8;
    animation: dash 0.8s linear infinite;
  }
  .beam-up { animation-direction: reverse; }
  @keyframes dash { to { stroke-dashoffset: -16; } }

  .defect-glow { animation: glow 1.6s ease-in-out infinite; }
  @keyframes glow {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.4; }
    50% { opacity: 1; }
  }

  /* ---------- Outline slide ---------- */
  .part-card { display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: center; padding: 26px 30px; }
  .part-num {
    font-family: var(--font-title);
    font-size: 64px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    min-width: 70px;
  }
  .part-card h3 { font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .part-card p { font-size: 18px; }
  .chip {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(38, 224, 196, 0.12);
    color: var(--accent-2);
    border: 1px solid rgba(38, 224, 196, 0.3);
  }

  /* ---------- Machine overview ---------- */
  .legend-item { display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 11px 16px; }
  .legend-num {
    width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent-2); color: #04121a;
    font-family: var(--font-title); font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px;
  }
  .legend-item p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.4; }

  /* ---------- PPE & safety slide ---------- */
  .ppe-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 14px; margin-top: 18px; }
  .ppe-item {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center;
    background: rgba(62, 166, 255, 0.06); border: 1px solid var(--panel-border); border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 18px 10px; gap: 12px;
  }
  .ppe-item .icon { margin: 0; width: 58px; height: 58px; border-radius: 16px; background: rgba(38, 224, 196, 0.12); border-color: rgba(38, 224, 196, 0.35); }
  .ppe-item .icon svg { width: 30px; height: 30px; stroke: var(--accent-2); }
  .ppe-item span { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.25; }
  .safety ul.clean li { font-size: 19px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .safety ul.clean li::before { background: var(--warn); }
  .info-band {
    display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center; margin-top: 16px;
    background: rgba(75, 227, 138, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(75, 227, 138, 0.35); border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 16px;
  }
  .info-band p { font-size: 16px; }

  /* ---------- Instruction manual steps ---------- */
  .step { display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 30px 28px; }
  .step-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .step-num { font-family: var(--font-title); font-size: 72px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; }
  .step .icon { width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 18px; margin: 0; }
  .step .icon svg { width: 32px; height: 32px; }
  .step h3 { font-size: 27px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .step p { font-size: 19px; }
  .tip {
    display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center;
    background: rgba(75, 227, 138, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(75, 227, 138, 0.35);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 18px;
  }
  .tip p { font-size: 17px; }

  /* ---------- Troubleshooting ---------- */
  .symptom {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
    border-color: rgba(255, 122, 89, 0.5); background: rgba(255, 122, 89, 0.08);
    padding: 16px 22px; margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .symptom p { font-size: 21px; color: var(--text); }
  .ts-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 50px 1fr; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr 1fr 1fr; row-gap: 12px; }
  .ts-label { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 2px; }
  .ts-cause { border-color: rgba(255, 122, 89, 0.3); padding: 14px 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; }
  .ts-fix { border-color: rgba(75, 227, 138, 0.35); background: rgba(75, 227, 138, 0.06); padding: 14px 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; }
  .ts-cause p, .ts-fix p { font-size: 19px; }
  .ts-arrow { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .ts-arrow svg { width: 28px; height: 28px; stroke: var(--accent-2); fill: none; stroke-width: 2.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }

  /* ---------- Conclusion ---------- */
  .tall .card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 60px 28px 30px; }
  .tall .big-number { font-size: 90px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .tall h3 { font-size: 27px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .tall p { font-size: 20px; }

  /* ---------- UI: progress, counter, notes ---------- */
  #progress {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    height: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
    transition: width 0.4s ease;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  #footer {
    position: absolute;
    left: 80px;
    right: 40px;
    bottom: 22px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    z-index: 10;
  }

  #timer.over { color: var(--warn); }

  #notes {
    position: fixed;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: 20px;
    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(20px);
    width: min(900px, 92vw);
    max-height: 38vh;
    overflow-y: auto;
    background: rgba(5, 10, 20, 0.95);
    border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 18px 22px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text);
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
    z-index: 100;
  }
  #notes.show { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); pointer-events: auto; }
  #notes .n-title { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--accent-2); letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 8px; }

  #help {
    position: fixed;
    top: 14px;
    left: 14px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #4f6282;
    z-index: 100;
    transition: opacity 0.5s;
  }

  .speaker-notes { display: none; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="help">← → navigate · N notes · F fullscreen · T reset timer</div>

<div id="viewport">
  <div id="stage">

    <!-- =============== SLIDE 1 — TITLE =============== -->
    <section class="slide" data-speaker="A">
      <svg class="wave-bg" viewBox="0 0 700 700">
        <circle cx="350" cy="350" r="340"/>
        <circle cx="350" cy="350" r="340"/>
        <circle cx="350" cy="350" r="340"/>
        <circle cx="350" cy="350" r="340"/>
      </svg>

      <div style="margin-top: auto; margin-bottom: auto; max-width: 780px; position: relative;">
        <div class="kicker reveal" style="--i:0">Ultrasonic Testing (UT)</div>
        <h1 class="reveal" style="--i:1">The Ultrasonic<br><span class="grad">Flaw Detector</span></h1>
        <p class="reveal" style="--i:2; font-size: 24px; margin-top: 22px;">Seeing inside materials with sound</p>

        <div class="reveal" style="--i:3; display: flex; gap: 16px; margin-top: 46px;">
          <div class="card" style="padding: 14px 22px;">
            <p style="font-size: 13px; font-family: var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: 1px;">PRESENTED BY</p>
            <p style="color: var(--text); font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600;">Yannis  &amp; Victor</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card" style="padding: 14px 22px;">
            <p style="font-size: 13px; font-family: var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: 1px;">CLASS</p>
            <p style="color: var(--text); font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600;">English presentation</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="speaker-notes">
        Hello everyone. Today, [Name 2] and I are going to present a technical machine: the ultrasonic flaw detector. It is a machine that uses sound to see inside materials and find hidden defects.
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- =============== SLIDE 2 — OUTLINE =============== -->
    <section class="slide" data-speaker="A">
      <div class="kicker reveal" style="--i:0">Outline</div>
      <h2 class="reveal" style="--i:1">Our <span class="grad">presentation</span></h2>

      <div class="grid-2" style="flex: 1; grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;">
        <div class="card part-card reveal" style="--i:2;">
          <div class="part-num grad">01</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Presenting the object</h3>
            <p>What is it used for? Overview of the machine</p>
            <span class="chip">SPEAKER A</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card part-card reveal" style="--i:3;">
          <div class="part-num grad">02</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Safety precautions</h3>
            <p>The PPE we need and the rules to follow</p>
            <span class="chip">SPEAKER A</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card part-card reveal" style="--i:4;">
          <div class="part-num grad">03</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Instruction manual</h3>
            <p>How to use the machine, step by step</p>
            <span class="chip">SPEAKER B</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card part-card reveal" style="--i:5;">
          <div class="part-num grad">04</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Troubleshooting</h3>
            <p>Two common problems and how to solve them</p>
            <span class="chip">SPEAKER B</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="speaker-notes">
        Our presentation has four parts. First, I will present the machine: what it is used for and an overview of its parts. Second, I will talk about safety: the PPE we need and the safety precautions. Then, [Name 2] will explain how to use the machine, step by step. And finally, [Name 2] will present two common problems and how to solve them.
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- =============== SLIDE 3 — PART 1: WHAT IS IT USED FOR =============== -->
    <section class="slide" data-speaker="A">
      <div class="kicker reveal" style="--i:0">Part 1 · Presenting the object</div>
      <h2 class="reveal" style="--i:1">What is it <span class="grad">used for</span>?</h2>

      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr; gap: 24px; flex: 1;">
        <div class="card reveal" style="--i:2; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;">
          <p style="font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--text);">
            An <strong class="grad">ultrasonic flaw detector</strong> is a portable machine that sends <strong>high-frequency sound</strong> into a material to find <strong>hidden defects</strong>.
          </p>
          <div class="tip" style="margin-top: 26px;">
            <div class="pc-dot dot-good">✓</div>
            <p>It is a <strong>Non-Destructive Testing</strong> (NDT) method: the part is <strong>not damaged</strong> and can still be used after the test.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;">
          <div class="card reveal" style="--i:3; display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: center; padding: 18px 22px;">
            <div class="icon" style="margin: 0;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 4 L10 10 L8 14 L14 20"/><path d="M14 4 L20 10"/></svg></div>
            <div><h3 style="margin-bottom: 2px;">Find cracks</h3><p style="font-size: 17px;">Detect cracks and holes inside metal parts.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal" style="--i:4; display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: center; padding: 18px 22px;">
            <div class="icon" style="margin: 0;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="10" rx="1"/><path d="M8 4 L8 20" stroke-dasharray="2 2"/></svg></div>
            <div><h3 style="margin-bottom: 2px;">Measure thickness</h3><p style="font-size: 17px;">Check if a pipe or a tank is damaged by corrosion.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal" style="--i:5; display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: center; padding: 18px 22px;">
            <div class="icon" style="margin: 0;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 18 L10 18 L12 14 L14 18 L21 18"/><path d="M12 14 L12 6"/><circle cx="12" cy="5" r="1.5"/></svg></div>
            <div><h3 style="margin-bottom: 2px;">Check welds</h3><p style="font-size: 17px;">Make sure welded joints are strong and safe.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal" style="--i:6; padding: 16px 22px;">
            <p style="font-size: 16px;"><strong>Used in:</strong> aerospace · oil &amp; gas · railways · power plants · manufacturing</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="speaker-notes">
        So, what is an ultrasonic flaw detector? It is a portable machine that sends high-frequency sound, called ultrasound, into a material to find hidden defects. It is a non-destructive testing method: we don't damage the part, so it can still be used after the test. We use it for three main things: to find cracks inside metal parts, to measure the thickness of pipes and tanks to check for corrosion, and to check that welds are strong and safe. It is used in many industries, like aerospace, oil and gas, railways and power plants.
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- =============== SLIDE 4 — PART 1: OVERVIEW OF THE MACHINE =============== -->
    <section class="slide" data-speaker="A">
      <div class="kicker reveal" style="--i:0">Part 1 · Presenting the object</div>
      <h2 class="reveal" style="--i:1">Overview of <span class="grad">the machine</span></h2>

      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1fr; gap: 24px; flex: 1;">
        <div class="card reveal" style="--i:2; padding: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 560 400" width="100%" height="100%">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="steelA" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
                <stop offset="0" stop-color="#40526f"/>
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#26334a"/>
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <!-- handle -->
            <path d="M90 42 V28 a8 8 0 0 1 8 -8 H242 a8 8 0 0 1 8 8 V42" stroke="var(--steel-light)" stroke-width="6" fill="none"/>
            <!-- body -->
            <rect x="40" y="40" width="260" height="195" rx="18" fill="#16243b" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2"/>
            <!-- screen -->
            <rect x="60" y="60" width="160" height="112" rx="6" fill="#06101d" stroke="var(--accent-2)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <polyline points="66,160 70,78 74,155 80,158 120,158 150,158 156,100 160,158 214,158" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent-2)" stroke-width="2"/>
